        ST("William", two("To the Ends of the Earth (chapter 2)", "To the Ends of the Earth (chapitre 2)"), two("Camp south of Heartland Oil Fields; plant requests", "Camp au sud de Heartland Oil Fields ; cueillette de plantes")),
