        ST("Jeremiah Compson", two("The Iniquities of History (2 parts, chapter 3, after \"An Honest Mistake\")", "The Iniquities of History (2 parties, chapitre 3, après \"An Honest Mistake\")"), two("Bench outside Rhodes station; Compson's Stead; his camp at Eris Field", "Banc devant la gare de Rhodes ; Compson's Stead ; son camp à Eris Field")),
